OL,3,GNEWSASeventh person charged in Thailand
OL,4,Ateenage drug couriers case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seventh person is facing charges
OL,7,Fafter two teenagers from Cardiff were
OL,8,Fallegedly trafficked to Thailand to
OL,9,Fsmuggle drugs.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Police said Carrie-Anne
OL,12,FDreyer, 39, of Llantwit Major, had been
OL,13,Fcharged with conspiring to evade a ban
OL,14,Fon importing a class B drug and four
OL,15,Fcounts of conspiring to arrange travel
OL,16,Ffor another person with a view to
OL,17,Fexploitation.
OL,19,FShe is in custody and due to appear at
OL,20,FCardiff Magistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
