OL,3,GNEWSASeventh person charged in Thailand
OL,4,Ateenage drug couriers case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe teenagers from Cardiff, both 17,
OL,7,Fwere arrested in Thailand in June and
OL,8,Fremain in custody.
